    id: 'case-cross-marriage-1445',
    titleZh: '臺北高等行政法院 109 年度訴字第 1445 號判決',
    titleEn: 'Taipei High Administrative Court Judgment 109-Su-1445',
    shortTitleZh: '首例跨國同婚勝訴案',
